{"The default value `timezone.now()` for the `queued` field in the `AssignmentSource` dataclass is evaluated once at class-definition (module import) time, not per-instance. Every `AssignmentSource` created without an explicit `queued` argument receives a stale timestamp from server startup, defeating any time-based loop-prevention logic. Should be replaced with `queued: datetime = field(default_factory=timezone.now)` so that `timezone.now` is called fresh for each new instance.": 0.9808415174484253}